SMART (subs.):
(1) तीव्रवेदना and sim. comp.s.;
(2) शूलम्।

SMARTLY:
(1) तीक्ष्णम्: v. Sharply;
(2) तूर्णम्
: v. Quickly;
(3) शोभनम्।: v. Beautifully;
(4) सरसम् (=wittily).

SMARTNESS:
(1) तीक्ष्णता: v. Sharpness;
(2)
लाघवम्: v. Quickness, dexterity;
(3)
वैदग्धम्: v. Skilfulness;
(4) रसिकता (= witti-
-ness);
(5) शोभा: v. Beauty;
(6) वेगः: v.
Impetuosity.
